<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0675_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Joey</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0675_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, can I get your number?\nI’ll ring you up to scrap. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0675_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ll ring you whenever I get the urge\nto scrap!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0675_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, aight...\nBut I ain’t losin’ to you again!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0675_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Can I get your number?\rI ain’t tryna lose to you again!\nWe gotta scrap again, OK? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0675_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">And ANOTHER L...\nNo doubt about it--you tough.\rGettin’ beat this much actually feel\ngood now!\rHere, take this.\nUse it to get even tougher. That’ll\ftoughen me up too!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0675_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, you right nearby, ain’t you?\nWhy you callin’? Come talk to me!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0675_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, you remember my super-hard\n{STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0}?\rMy {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} different from\nregular {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0}.\rIt’s like my {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} in the top\npercentage of {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0}.\rYou feel what I’m sayin’?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0675_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh yeah, I took down a {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}\nin the wild the other day.\rIt was light work. Well, I guess\nit can’t be helped, us bein’ so tough.\rAight. Later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0675_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh yeah, I saw a wild {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}!\nI thought about goin’ for it, but\fthen I fumbled!\rOh well. That’s just how\nit go. I ain’t real good at catchin’\fhomies...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0675_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Let’s link up and scrap!\nI promise it’s gon’ be different!\r{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0} is where I’ll be.\nHolla when you get here.\rAight. Later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0675_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What’s takin’ so long, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\rLet’s get down and scrap already!\nI’m waitin’ on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0675_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m studyin’ {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0}’s moves\nand cookin’ up some strategies.\rWhen I come up with a good one,\nlet’s scrap!\rAight. Later!</language>
	</row>
</body>
